"text": "You are wearing a grey sequined hat with a net veil, light-blue jeans that fade toward the hem, and black earrings in gold-tone metal. On your feet are ginger suede ankle boots with shearling lining, carrying you through the frosty autumn air. A structured black mid-length coat wraps around you for warmth, while a relaxed denim blazer adds a cool, casual layer beneath it all. This look balances your celebration vibe: the sparkle of the hat catches attention at the top, the jeans ground you in comfort, and the boots keep you ready to dance or walk through the city. The black coat provides serious elegance, while the denim jacket introduces an easygoing touch perfect for a festive dinner.",
